# The monorepo image (root Dockerfile + docker-compose friday-universe-api) needs
# every agent's importable sources on its PYTHONPATH (see docker-compose.yml), so
# the whole tree is part of the build context. Only never-bake items are excluded
# below. (History: this file previously excluded everything except Forge/Futuris/
# Sentinel/mesh, which starved the image of FRIDAY/apps/core/src and produced
# "ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'friday_core'" at container startup -
# recorded in docs/handoff.md and docs/collaboration/ACTIVITY_LOG.md 2026-11-08.)

# Never bake local credentials, VCS data, generated caches, or workspace state
# into an image built with the monorepo as its context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/node_modules/**
**/workspaces/**
**/artifacts/**
**/reports_and_data/**
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
